{"tts": [{"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Not every dream in the Archive is a happy one.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s04_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "A nightmare has broken free. And it belongs to your friend.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s07_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Mira? Is this real? It's the crows again. Since I was little, always the crows.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s08_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "It's your nightmare. It escaped. But it can only be as big as you let it.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s10_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "I'm not brave like you. I joke around so nobody sees I'm scared.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s11_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Theo, you walked into a magic archive with cookies. You're the bravest person I know.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s13_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Okay. Okay. Crows. Listen up.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s14_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "You're just birds. Loud, annoying birds. And I'm not little anymore!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s17_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "I did that. I actually did that!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s18_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "See? Scary dreams just want someone to look at them.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s20_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "You returned a nightmare without fighting it. The Archive has not seen that in a hundred years.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s21_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "But hurry. Tomorrow is the last night. The seventh.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b06/s22_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "One night left. And the dream still needed to come home.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}]}